 Overall rules for implementation
  -Use a TDD approach for both the buffer content and screen redraw behavior. Be thorough to cover corner cases.
  -Create failing tests for an increment of change, make the tests pass and then commit
  -Refactor before and after an increment of change, to make the change easier and consolidate after the change
  -Reuse existing logic as much as possible, e.g. by extracting helper methods
